The task text, start websites, levels and reference lengths in
src/agentenv_benchmarks/bundles/online-mind2web/tasks/ are derived from Online-Mind2Web
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/osunlp/Online-Mind2Web, revision
eacad896a84dc5b65e29b0b06e4699ab0544d701), by the OSU NLP Group, licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Each task is wrapped in agent-env steps, which keep its
text unchanged, and its prompt is "Go to {website} and {task}", with the task's first word lowercased.

